        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kevin Bacon, Lawrence Turman, Sosie Bacon, Curtis Hanson, Meryl Streep, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, Joseph Mazzello, Kyra Sedgwick\n- Works: The River Wild, Footloose, JFK, A Few Good Men, Apollo 13, Mystic River, Pretty Poison, The Great White Hope, The Thing, Mass Appeal, Short Circuit, American History X\n\nFacts:\n- Lawrence Turman produced the films Pretty Poison (1968), The Great White Hope (1970), The Thing (1982), Mass Appeal (1984), Short Circuit (1986), The River Wild (1994), and American History X (1998).\n- Kevin Bacon was born on July 8, 1958, and he is an American actor and musician.\n- Kevin Bacon's notable films include Footloose (1984), JFK (1991), A Few Good Men (1992), Apollo 13 (1995), and Mystic River (2003).\n- The River Wild is a 1994 American adventure crime-thriller film directed by Curtis Hanson and starring Meryl Streep, Kevin Bacon, David Strathairn, John C. Reilly, Benjamin Bratt, and Joseph Mazzello as Roarke.\n- Sosie Ruth Bacon was born on March 15, 1992, and she is an American actress and the daughter of actors Kevin Bacon and Kyra Sedgwick.",
